  "details": "[VRChat 2026.3.3 (OPEN BETA)](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202633-open-beta) `Build 1912` had an intentional change:\n\n> Updated styling and format of the product details page in the VRChat shop.\n\nI think this is an UI/UX regression when it comes to world perk pop-ups, and I'd like to see which products are contained in a world perk pop-up again.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Launch into [Elite's RNG Land](https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_50a4de63-927a-4d7e-b322-13d715176ef1/info) world.\n\n2. Click through the world intro buttons. Find the tip jar close to the entrance/fountain, on the left side from the entrance.\n\n3. Click any of the \"Leave a Tip!\" credit numbers to show a world perk for a tip.\n\nExpected result: See the \"Contains 1 product: Graciously Support the Creator\" with clarifying description telling it's a donation towards the world creator, below the world perk product details.\n\nActual result: Only the product details are shown; the information about the contents of a world perk being bought has become lost, particularly the description \"This is a donation; the VRChat Credits will go directly to Eliteiment!\" is missing.",
